#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline. -> T1.P5 | 2. It must be tough to be such a popular girl. -> T1.P13 | 3. Actually, I'm the one who's been stalking you. -> T1.P20
msgctxt "4476_Noa"
msgid "No. That's why I'm so scared."
msgstr "No, nunca. Es por eso que tengo mucho miedo..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4488_Akiyama"
msgid "Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline. He might see that and think you're living with a man. It could scare him off."
msgstr "¿Y si cuelgas ropa interior masculina en el tendedero? Puede que se asusten al enterarse que vives con tu novio."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4500_Noa"
msgid "Do girls really do that?"
msgstr "Pero qué interesante. ♪\n"
"¿Las chicas realmente hacen eso?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4512_Akiyama"
msgid "I think so. Why don't you give it a try?"
msgstr "Eso creo. ¿Por qué no lo intentas?"

msgctxt "4524_Noa"
msgid "Ha! That might not be a bad idea. I'll think about it. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡A-ha-ha! Pues parece una buena idea. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4536_Noa"
msgid "But I don't think he follows me home. It's only when I'm here in Kamurocho, or at the train station."
msgstr "Pero creo que no me sigue hasta casa. Siento eso cuando estoy aquí en Kamurocho, o en la estación de tren."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4548_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh. Then it probably wouldn't work."
msgstr "Oh, ya veo... Entonces no creo que sirva."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4560_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, you could just wait and see how things play out. Kamurocho's a pretty busy neighborhood, so I doubt he'd try anything strange."
msgstr "Bueno, podrías esperar y ver cómo se desarrollan las cosas. Kamurocho es un barrio bastante concurrido, así que dudo que intente algo extraño."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Try hanging men's underwear on your clothesline.
msgctxt "4572_Noa"
msgid "I hope not."
msgstr "Espero que no..."

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
