#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 08 00 00 00 18 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "8772_Akiyama"
msgid "So they have to be rich?"
msgstr "¿Entonces tienen que ser ricos?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8784_Noa"
msgid "I didn't say that. I don't care about money."
msgstr "Yo no he dicho eso. No me importa el dinero."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8796_Akiyama"
msgid "But don't most hardworking people end up having money anyways?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿acaso la mayoría de las personas trabajadoras no terminan teniendo dinero de todos modos?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8808_Noa"
msgid "No! Not everybody who works hard is rewarded for it, you know."
msgstr "¡No! No todos los que trabajan duro son recompensados por ello."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8820_Noa"
msgid "I just want him to do his best!"
msgstr "¡Solo quiero que haga lo mejor que pueda!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8832_Akiyama"
msgid "But the only way you'd know that is if you work together."
msgstr "Pero la única forma de saberlo es trabajando juntos."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8844_Akiyama"
msgid "That's the thing about money. You can see right away if somebody has it."
msgstr "Eso es lo que pasa con el dinero. Puedes ver inmediatamente si alguien lo tiene."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=13
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 13
#. y4:msg_talk=13
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T13.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So they have to be rich?
msgctxt "8856_Noa"
msgid "Hmm. That's true. I hadn't thought about that..."
msgstr "Mmm. Es verdad. No había pensado en eso..."

