msgstr "¡Por supuesto que sí! Hay una carrera casi todas las semanas en algún lugar."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They don't have races that often.
msgctxt "9204_Akiyama"
msgid "There is? I don't hear too much about them."
msgstr "¿Las hay? No oigo hablar mucho de ellas."

msgctxt "9216_Noa"
msgid "I should take you to one, then! I bet you'll love it. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Entonces debería llevarlo a una! Seguro que le encantará. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They don't have races that often.
msgctxt "9228_Akiyama"
msgid "Heh, if you say so. Do you need earplugs or something?"
msgstr "Si tú lo dices. ¿Necesitas tapones para los oídos o algo así?"

msgctxt "9240_Noa"
msgid "Oh no. It'd be a waste to wear earplugs at a race! The sound is half the fun! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Oh, no. ¡Sería un desperdicio llevar tapones a una carrera! ¡El sonido es la mitad de la diversión! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They don't have races that often.
msgctxt "9252_Akiyama"
msgid "That can't be good for your ears..."
msgstr "Eso no puede ser bueno para tus oídos..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Doesn't really sound like a date.
msgctxt "9264_Akiyama"
msgid "Doesn't really sound like a date. That's just hanging out."
msgstr "Realmente no suena como una cita. Eso es sólo pasar el rato."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Doesn't really sound like a date.
msgctxt "9276_Noa"
msgid "What's wrong with just hanging out? I think that would be plenty of fun."
msgstr "¿Qué hay de malo en pasar el rato? Creo que sería muy divertido."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Doesn't really sound like a date.
msgctxt "9288_Akiyama"
msgid "What about going to a movie or an amusement park?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal ir al cine o a un parque de atracciones?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Doesn't really sound like a date.
msgctxt "9300_Noa"
msgid "Oh, come on. I'm not a high school kid going out on her first date. I'd rather do everyday things with someone I like."
msgstr "Oh, vamos. No soy una chica de secundaria saliendo en su primera cita. Prefiero hacer cosas cotidianas con alguien que me guste."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Doesn't really sound like a date.
msgctxt "9312_Akiyama"
msgid "Really? That's all?"
msgstr "¿De verdad? ¿Eso es todo?"

msgctxt "9324_Noa"
msgid "Sure. You'll understand sooner or later. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Claro, tarde o temprano lo entenderá. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think we have the same tastes.
msgctxt "9336_Akiyama"
msgid "I don't think we have the same tastes. Why would you want to play video games at home when you're on a date?"
msgstr "No creo que tengamos los mismos gustos. ¿Por qué querrías jugar a videojuegos en casa cuando estás en una cita?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think we have the same tastes.
msgctxt "9348_Noa"
msgid "Because it'd be fun to play video games with a guy I like."
msgstr "Porque sería divertido jugar a videojuegos con un hombre que me gusta."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think we have the same tastes.
msgctxt "9360_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm. If a girl said she wanted to go home to play video games during our date, I don't know what I'd think."
msgstr "Hmm. Si una chica me dijera que quiere irse a casa a jugar a videojuegos durante nuestra cita, no sé qué pensaría."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think we have the same tastes.
msgctxt "9372_Noa"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think we have the same tastes.
msgctxt "9384_Noa"
msgid "But then, I'm easily affected by other people. If my date wanted to do something I'd normally find odd, I'd probably give it a try."
msgstr "Pero bueno, me dejo influenciar fácilmente por los demás. Si mi cita quisiera hacer algo que normalmente me parecería raro, probablemente lo probaría."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=14
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 14
#. y4:msg_talk=14
#. y4:msg_phrase=27
#. y4:msg_location=T14.P27
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think we have the same tastes.
msgctxt "9396_Akiyama"
msgid "Heh. Flexibility is definitely valuable, especially for a ballet dancer."
msgstr "Je. La flexibilidad es definitivamente valiosa, especialmente para una bailarina de ballet."

msgctxt "9408_Noa"
msgid "Oh, ha ha. Very funny, mister. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Oh, ja, ja. Muy gracioso, señor. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "9420_Noa"
msgid "One of my friends started working as a race queen."
msgstr "Una de mis amigas empezó a trabajar como reina de las carreras."

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=7
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 7
#. y4:msg_talk=7
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T7.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_decision_group=7
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. You'd probably be an expensive girlfriend. -> T7.P10 | 2. Were you just pretending to like it? -> T7.P17 | 3. Do you like to drive fast yourself? -> T7.P25
msgctxt "9432_Akiyama"
msgid "Wow..."
msgstr "Vaya..."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "9444_Noa"
msgid "Yeah. I wish I could do that too!"
msgstr "Sí. ¡Desearia poder hacer lo mismo!"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "9456_Akiyama"
msgid "Really? You'd like to be a race queen?"
msgstr "¿De verdad? ¿Te gustaría ser una reina de las carreras?"

msgctxt "9468_Noa"
msgid "Yep! Every time I go to a race, I think of how much fun it would be. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Sí! Cada vez que voy a una carrera, pienso en lo divertido que sería. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=166
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T166.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T15.P5
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T15.P5..P11
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=They do add something to the race, don't they?
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 05 00 00 00 2e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "9480_Akiyama"
msgid "They do add something to the race, don't they?"
msgstr "Aportan algo a la carrera, ¿no?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They do add something to the race, don't they?
msgctxt "9492_Noa"
msgid "Yeah! They make it a lot more fun to watch."
msgstr "¡Sí! Hacen que sea mucho más divertido de ver."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They do add something to the race, don't they?
msgctxt "9504_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm... You know, it's good for the audience, but what about the drivers?"
msgstr "Hmm... Ya sabes, es bueno para el público, pero ¿qué pasa con los conductores?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You sound like a guy.
msgctxt "9516_Noa"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They do add something to the race, don't they?
msgctxt "9528_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, it must be hard to concentrate with pretty girls in bathing suits running around."
msgstr "Debe ser difícil concentrarse con chicas bonitas en trajes de baño correteando por ahí."

msgctxt "9540_Noa"
msgid "Hahaha! Don't worry about them. Once the race starts, race queens are the last thing on their minds. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Ja, ja, ja! No te preocupes por ellos. Una vez que empieza la carrera, las reinas de las carreras son la última cosa que queda en sus mentes. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They do add something to the race, don't they?
msgctxt "9552_Akiyama"
msgid "Heh, yeah."
msgstr "Je, sí."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Maybe you could dress up like one here.
msgctxt "9564_Akiyama"
msgid "Maybe you could dress up like one here. You could have a race queen day."
msgstr "Tal vez podrías vestirte como una aquí. Podrías tener un día de reina de las carreras."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Maybe you could dress up like one here.
msgctxt "9576_Noa"
msgid "What!? We couldn't do that at the club!"
msgstr "¿¡Qué!? ¡No podríamos hacer eso en el club!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Maybe you could dress up like one here.
msgctxt "9588_Akiyama"
msgid "Heh, it wouldn't be so bad."
msgstr "Je, no estaria tan mal."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Maybe you could dress up like one here.
msgctxt "9600_Noa"
msgid "But it wouldn't mean anything without the cars!"
msgstr "¡Pero no significaría nada sin los autos!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Maybe you could dress up like one here.
msgctxt "9612_Akiyama"
msgid "I don't know about that. Pretty girls in bathing suits would mean a lot to me."
msgstr "Yo no sé nada de eso. Chicas bonitas en traje de baño significaría mucho para mí."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Maybe you could dress up like one here.
msgctxt "9624_Noa"
msgid "Ugh, why is it that men only ever have one thing on their minds?"
msgstr "Uf, ¿por qué es que los hombres solo tienen una cosa en mente?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They just like talking to each other like that.
msgctxt "9636_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Wouldn't that be embarrassing?
msgctxt "9648_Akiyama"
msgid "Wouldn't that be embarrassing? I mean, you'd be in a bathing suit. A pretty skimpy one, too."
msgstr "¿No sería vergonzoso? Quiero decir, estarías en traje de baño. Uno bastante revelador, además."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Wouldn't that be embarrassing?
msgctxt "9660_Noa"
msgid "Ha, I don't mind! I'm used to wearing leotards for ballet."
msgstr "¡Ja, no me importa! Estoy acostumbrada a llevar leotardos para ballet."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Wouldn't that be embarrassing?
msgctxt "9672_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, that's right. So you're used to having people stare at you."
msgstr "Oh, es verdad. Así que estás acostumbrada a que la gente te mire."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Wouldn't that be embarrassing?
msgctxt "9684_Noa"
msgid "Yep. And you don't have to dance as a race queen, so it'd be much easier."
msgstr "Sip. Y no tienes que bailar como una reina de las carreras, así que sería mucho más fácil."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=15
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 15
#. y4:msg_talk=15
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T15.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Wouldn't that be embarrassing?
msgctxt "9696_Akiyama"
msgid "Okay. It might be a good fit for you, then. You're certainly pretty enough."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Podría ser una buena opción para ti, entonces. Ciertamente eres bastante bonita."

msgctxt "9708_Noa"
msgid "Hehe, thank you! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Jeje, ¡gracias! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "9720_Noa"
msgid "The other day, one of the kids at my ballet class said－"
msgstr "El otro día, una de las niñas de mi clase de ballet dijo -"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "9732_Akiyama"
msgid "Wait, what? You're a ballet teacher too?"
msgstr "¿Espera, qué? ¿También eres profesora de ballet?"

msgctxt "9744_Noa"
msgid "Oh, yes! I teach ballet to kids once a week. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Oh, sí! Doy clases de ballet a niñas una vez a la semana. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "9756_Akiyama"
msgid "I knew you danced, but I had no idea you taught."
msgstr "Sabía que bailabas, pero no tenía ni idea de que enseñaras."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "9768_Noa"
msgid "Heh, yeah. It's a lot of fun!"
msgstr "Je, sí. ¡Es muy divertido!"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "9780_Noa"
msgid "Anyway, I usually go to class without any makeup on, but this time I went completely made up."
msgstr "De todos modos, suelo ir a clase sin maquillaje, pero esta vez fui completamente maquillada."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "9792_Noa"
msgid "All of the girls kept saying how cute I was."
msgstr "Todas las chicas seguían diciendo lo linda que era."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "9804_Akiyama"
msgid "Heh, I bet."
msgstr "Je, estoy seguro de eso."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "9816_Noa"
msgid "Then one of them said, \"You look a hundred times better than usual!\""
msgstr "Entonces una de ellas dijo: \"¡Te ves cien veces mejor que de costumbre!\""

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "9828_Akiyama"
msgid "Ha! That's not the kind of compliment you really want to get, is it?"
msgstr "¡Ja! Ese no es el tipo de cumplido que quieres recibir, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=16
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh? -> T16.P11 | 2. Kids are so innocent. -> T16.P16 | 3. What do you do to look a hundred times better? -> T16.P22
msgctxt "9840_Noa"
msgid "Oh, I thought it was hilarious! I mean, I'm a hundred times better looking with makeup!?"
msgstr "Oh, ¡pensé que era divertidísimo! Quiero decir, ¿¡soy cien veces más bonita con maquillaje!?"

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=169
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T169.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T16.P11
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T16.P11..P15
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh?
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 0b 00 00 00 31 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "9852_Akiyama"
msgid "So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh?"
msgstr "Así que te ves terrible sin maquillaje, ¿eh?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh?
msgctxt "9864_Noa"
msgid "Yeah! I hope you never see me without it!"
msgstr "¡Sí! ¡Espero que usted nunca me vea sin maquillaje!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh?
msgctxt "9876_Akiyama"
msgid "You know, girls always say that, but it can't be that bad. I'd like to see you without makeup."
msgstr "Las chicas siempre dicen eso, pero no puede ser tan malo. Me gustaría verte sin maquillaje."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh?
msgctxt "9888_Noa"
msgid "No! It's never going to happen! Forget about it!"
msgstr "¡No! ¡Nunca va a suceder! ¡Olvídalo!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=So, you look pretty terrible without makeup, huh?
msgctxt "9900_Akiyama"
msgid "Whoa. Okay..."
msgstr "Wow. Está bien..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Kids are so innocent.
msgctxt "9912_Akiyama"
msgid "Kids are so innocent. They just say whatever pops into their heads."
msgstr "Los niños son tan inocentes. Dicen lo primero que se les pasa por la cabeza."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Kids are so innocent.
msgctxt "9924_Noa"
msgid "I know. They don't mean anything by it, so it doesn't bother me."
msgstr "Lo sé. No quieren decir nada con eso, así que no me molesta."

msgctxt "9936_Noa"
msgid "And they're so cute! Seeing the little girls in my class dancing! It's adorable! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Y son tan lindos! ¡Ver bailar a las niñas de mi clase! ¡Es adorable! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Kids are so innocent.
msgctxt "9948_Akiyama"
msgid "I guess that's ballet for you. A world of innocent, cute little girls."
msgstr "Supongo que eso es ballet para ti. Un mundo de niñas inocentes y lindas."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Kids are so innocent.
msgctxt "9960_Noa"
msgid "Yeah. You should stay away."
msgstr "Sí. Usted debería alejarse."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Kids are so innocent.
msgctxt "9972_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah, yeah."
msgstr "Sí, sí."

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=171
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T171.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T16.P22
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T16.P22..P27
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=What do you do to look a hundred times better?
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 16 00 00 00 2e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "9984_Akiyama"
msgid "What do you do to look a hundred times better?"
msgstr "¿Qué haces para estar cien veces mejor?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What do you do to look a hundred times better?
msgctxt "9996_Noa"
msgid "Haha! Well, kids exaggerate everything."
msgstr "¡Ja, ja! Bueno, los niños exageran todo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What do you do to look a hundred times better?
msgctxt "10008_Akiyama"
msgid "True enough. I once heard a boy telling another he owed him a billion yen."
msgstr "Cierto. Una vez oí a un chico decirle a otro que le debía mil millones de yenes."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What do you do to look a hundred times better?
msgctxt "10020_Noa"
msgid "Right. They don't know how big a number that is."
msgstr "¿Verdad?. No saben lo grande que es ese número."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=16
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 16
#. y4:msg_talk=16
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T16.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What do you do to look a hundred times better?
msgctxt "10032_Akiyama"
msgid "So makeup doesn't make you a hundred times more beautiful, then?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿el maquillaje no te hace cien veces más bella?"

msgctxt "10044_Noa"
msgid "I'm afraid not. Maybe ten times. Haha! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Me temo que no. Tal vez diez veces. ¡Ja, ja! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10056_Noa"
msgid "Um, what do you think of wearing an all-denim outfit?"
msgstr "Um, ¿qué piensas de usar un atuendo de solo mezclilla?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "10068_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm? Why do you ask?"
msgstr "¿Hmm? ¿Por qué lo preguntas?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10080_Noa"
msgid "Well, my friend went out on a date, and the guy showed up wearing a jean jacket and blue jeans!"
msgstr "Bueno, mi amiga salió en una cita, ¡y el chico apareció con una chaqueta de mezclilla y jeans azules!"

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=17
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. That's a little much. -> T17.P4 | 2. What's wrong with that? -> T17.P10 | 3. That was the style back in the day. -> T17.P16
msgctxt "10092_Noa"
msgid "Can you believe that!?"
msgstr "¿¡Puedes creerlo!?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That's a little much.
msgctxt "10104_Akiyama"
msgid "That's a little much. Doesn't that guy have any fashion sense?"
msgstr "Eso es un poco excesivo. ¿Ese chico no tiene sentido del estilo?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That's a little much.
msgctxt "10116_Noa"
msgid "I know! A completely denim outfit? Unbelievable!"
msgstr "¡Lo sé! ¿Un conjunto completamente de mezclilla? ¡Increíble!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That's a little much.
msgctxt "10128_Akiyama"
msgid "Didn't your friend know how the guy dressed before going out with him?"
msgstr "¿No sabía tu amiga cómo vestía el chico antes de salir con él?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That's a little much.
msgctxt "10140_Noa"
msgid "She said he's normally okay."
msgstr "Ella dijo que normalmente se viste bien."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That's a little much.
msgctxt "10152_Akiyama"
msgid "Aw, maybe he wanted to get a new outfit for his date and went a bit overboard."
msgstr "Aw, tal vez quiso estrenar ropa nueva para la cita y se pasó un poco."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That's a little much.
msgctxt "10164_Noa"
msgid "Haha! That's probably it. But still, what was he thinking!?"
msgstr "¡Ja, ja! Probablemente sea eso. Pero aun así, ¿¡en qué estaba pensando!?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What's wrong with that?
msgctxt "10176_Akiyama"
msgid "What's wrong with that? Denim looks good on some people."
msgstr "¿Qué hay de malo en eso? La mezclilla se ven bien en algunas personas."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What's wrong with that?
msgctxt "10188_Noa"
msgid "What!? I'm talking head to toe, here! Head to toe!"
msgstr "¿¡Qué!? ¡Estoy hablando de pies a cabeza, aquí! ¡De pies a cabeza!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What's wrong with that?
msgctxt "10200_Akiyama"
msgid "So? What's the big deal?"
msgstr "¿Entonces? ¿Cuál es el problema?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What's wrong with that?
msgctxt "10212_Noa"
msgid "It's... It's just not done. I wouldn't wanna be seen in public with somebody like that."
msgstr "Es… es algo que simplemente no se hace. No querría que me vieran en público con alguien así."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What's wrong with that?
msgctxt "10224_Noa"
msgid "It'd take a serious weirdo to think that looks good."
msgstr "Hay que ser muy raro para pensar que eso queda bien."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What's wrong with that?
msgctxt "10236_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, okay..."
msgstr "Oh, esta bien..."

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=174
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T174.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T17.P16
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T17.P16..P23
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=That was the style back in the day.
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 10 00 00 00 23 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "10248_Akiyama"
msgid "That was the style back in the day."
msgstr "Ese era el estilo en su día."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10260_Noa"
msgid "What!? You're kidding!"
msgstr "¿¡Qué!? ¡Está bromeando!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10272_Akiyama"
msgid "No, really. Let me see..."
msgstr "No, en serio. Déjame ver..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10284_Akiyama"
msgid "It was probably before you were born. Thirty years ago, maybe. Men and women used to dress like that."
msgstr "Probablemente, fue antes de que nacieras. Hace treinta años, tal vez. Hombres y mujeres solían vestirse así."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10296_Noa"
msgid "Huh. That's news to me..."
msgstr "Eh. Eso es una novedad para mí..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10308_Akiyama"
msgid "But it does look a little unusual these days."
msgstr "Pero hoy en día parece un poco inusual."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10320_Noa"
msgid "Well, yeah! More than a little!"
msgstr "¡Bueno, sí! ¡Más que un poco!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=17
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 17
#. y4:msg_talk=17
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T17.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=That was the style back in the day.
msgctxt "10332_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I see."
msgstr "Oh, ya veo."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10344_Noa"
msgid "One of my customers got mad at me."
msgstr "Uno de mis clientes se enfadó conmigo."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "10356_Akiyama"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "¿Por qué?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10368_Noa"
msgid "Oh, I was talking about how my ex-boyfriend told me that I should take cooking classes."
msgstr "Oh, estaba hablando de cómo mi ex novio me dijo que debería tomar clases de cocina."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "10380_Akiyama"
msgid "Then what?"
msgstr "¿Y luego qué?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10392_Noa"
msgid "And I said going to classes is a big pain. I mean, you can learn to cook from books. So I never went."
msgstr "Y dije que ir a clases es una gran molestia. Quiero decir, puedes aprender a cocinar con los libros. Así que nunca fui."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10404_Noa"
msgid "Then this customer said, \"Cooking is an elegant balance of technique and sensitivity! You can't learn that from reading a book!\""
msgstr "Entonces este cliente dijo: \"¡La cocina es un elegante equilibrio de técnica y sensibilidad! Eso no se aprende leyendo un libro\"."

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_decision_group=18
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. He must have a short temper. -> T18.P7 | 2. Why'd he get so mad about something like that? -> T18.P15 | 3. I think he's right. -> T18.P26
msgctxt "10416_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah. I understand."
msgstr "Ah. Entiendo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He must have a short temper.
msgctxt "10428_Akiyama"
msgid "He must have a short temper. He shouldn't have snapped at you like that."
msgstr "Debe tener mal genio. No debería haberte gritado así."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He must have a short temper.
msgctxt "10440_Noa"
msgid "Yeah... But to tell you the truth, I've been thinking about what he said."
msgstr "Sí... Pero a decir verdad, he estado pensando en lo que dijo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You sound like a guy.
msgctxt "10452_Akiyama"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He must have a short temper.
msgctxt "10464_Noa"
msgid "I should study cooking properly."
msgstr "Debería estudiar cocina como es debido."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He must have a short temper.
msgctxt "10476_Noa"
msgid "Cooking's an important thing to be able to do, and I might as well learn the right way."
msgstr "Cocinar es algo importante que hay que saber hacer, y bien podría aprender la manera correcta."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He must have a short temper.
msgctxt "10488_Akiyama"
msgid "So you can't cook at all, huh?"
msgstr "Así que no puedes cocinar en absoluto, ¿eh?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They just like talking to each other like that.
msgctxt "10500_Noa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=6
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 6
#. y4:msg_talk=6
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T6.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you want to do it professionally?
msgctxt "10512_Akiyama"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Ya veo..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10524_Akiyama"
msgid "Why'd he get so mad about something like that? It's not like he's your father."
msgstr "¿Por qué se enfadaría tanto por algo así? No es como si fuera tu padre."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10536_Noa"
msgid "Yeah... He just took the whole thing so seriously."
msgstr "Sí... Se lo tomó todo muy en serio."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10548_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm. Maybe he wasn't really mad at you. He might have just been trying to help."
msgstr "Hmm. Tal vez no estaba realmente enojado contigo. Puede que sólo intentara ayudar."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10560_Noa"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad lo cree?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10572_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. It sounds like he really cares about cooking. That may have been all it was."
msgstr "Seguro. Suena como que realmente le importa cocinar. Eso puede haber sido todo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10584_Akiyama"
msgid "He was probably more excited than angry."
msgstr "Probablemente estaba más emocionado que enojado."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10596_Noa"
msgid "Huh. Maybe you're right!"
msgstr "Eh. ¡Tal vez tenga razón!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10608_Akiyama"
msgid "Heh. And you know, he might've known what he was talking about. Maybe you should take cooking classes."
msgstr "Je. Y ya sabes, él podría haber sabido de lo que estaba hablando. Tal vez deberías tomar clases de cocina."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10620_Akiyama"
msgid "I mean, do you know how to cook at all?"
msgstr "Quiero decir, ¿sabes cocinar en absoluto?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10632_Noa"
msgid "Hehe, nope!"
msgstr "Jeje, ¡nop!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10644_Akiyama"
msgid "Haha. At least you're honest."
msgstr "Ja, ja. Al menos eres honesta."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10656_Akiyama"
msgid "I think he's right. If you're not going to take cooking seriously, you probably shouldn't learn at all."
msgstr "Creo que tiene razón. Si no vas a tomarte la cocina en serio, probablemente no deberías aprender nada."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=27
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P27
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10668_Noa"
msgid "You really agree with him?"
msgstr "¿De verdad está de acuerdo con él?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=28
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P28
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10680_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. But it's nothing to get angry about."
msgstr "Seguro. Pero no es nada por lo que enfadarse."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10692_Noa"
msgid "Yeah. I was pretty shocked."
msgstr "Sí. Me quedé bastante impactada."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10704_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, maybe you can use this as an opportunity to start learning seriously."
msgstr "Bueno, quizá puedas aprovechar esta oportunidad para empezar a aprender en serio."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10716_Noa"
msgid "Okay. I could ask my mom!"
msgstr "Bien. ¡Podría preguntarle a mi mamá!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=32
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P32
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I think he's right.
msgctxt "10728_Akiyama"
msgid "That's not a bad idea. Good luck."
msgstr "No es una mala idea. Buena suerte."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10740_Noa"
msgid "I'm starting to think I really am stupid."
msgstr "Empiezo a pensar que soy realmente estúpida."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "10752_Akiyama"
msgid "What? Why do you say that? Did another customer get mad at you?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Por qué dices eso? ¿Otro cliente se enfadó contigo?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10764_Noa"
msgid "Yeah. He said I didn't know anything."
msgstr "Sí. Me dijo que yo no sabía nada."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "10776_Akiyama"
msgid "What ended up happening?"
msgstr "¿Qué terminó pasando?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10788_Noa"
msgid "He kept using all these words I'd never heard of. I couldn't follow what he was saying."
msgstr "No paraba de usar palabras que yo no conocía. No podía seguir lo que decía."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "10800_Noa"
msgid "Something about credit default swaps?"
msgstr "¿Algo sobre los swaps de incumplimiento crediticio?"

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=19
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Most people don't know about that kind of thing. -> T19.P7 | 2. What a jerk. -> T19.P13 | 3. Do you read much? -> T19.P21
msgctxt "10812_Noa"
msgid "I had no idea what he was talking about!"
msgstr "¡No tenía ni idea de lo que estaba hablando!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Most people don't know about that kind of thing.
msgctxt "10824_Akiyama"
msgid "Most people don't know about that kind of thing. You'd have to be in finance."
msgstr "La mayoría de la gente no sabe nada de eso. Tendrías que estar en las finanzas."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Most people don't know about that kind of thing.
msgctxt "10836_Noa"
msgid "Oh. So that's a specialized term?"
msgstr "Oh. Entonces, ¿ese es un término especializado?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Most people don't know about that kind of thing.
msgctxt "10848_Akiyama"
msgid "Yes. You could hear it on the news, but you don't use it outside of financial institutions."
msgstr "Sí. Se oye en las noticias, pero no se utiliza fuera de las instituciones financieras."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Most people don't know about that kind of thing.
msgctxt "10860_Noa"
msgid "Okay. Man, I hate it when people just assume everyone should understand everything they say."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Odio cuando la gente asume que todos deben entender lo que dicen."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Most people don't know about that kind of thing.
msgctxt "10872_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. Don't worry, you're not stupid."
msgstr "Sí. No te preocupes, no eres estúpida."

msgctxt "10884_Noa"
msgid "Hehe. Thanks. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Je, je. Gracias. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What a jerk.
msgctxt "10896_Akiyama"
msgid "What a jerk. He must've known you wouldn't understand."
msgstr "Qué imbécil. Él debe haber sabido que tú no lo entenderías."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "10908_Noa"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad lo cree?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What a jerk.
msgctxt "10920_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. He was probably teasing you. Or he was showing off."
msgstr "Sí. Probablemente te estaba tomando el pelo. O estaba presumiendo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What a jerk.
msgctxt "10932_Noa"
msgid "Oh. I thought it was my fault for not understanding."
msgstr "Oh. Pensé que era culpa mía por no entender."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What a jerk.
msgctxt "10944_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, you could try studying financial terms. Then you can surprise him next time."
msgstr "Bueno, podrías intentar estudiar términos financieros. Así podrás sorprenderlo la próxima vez."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What a jerk.
msgctxt "10956_Noa"
msgid "Haha, yeah! He'd be pretty surprised if I suddenly became an expert!"
msgstr "Ja, ja, ¡sí! ¡Se sorprendería mucho si de repente me convirtiera en una experta!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=What a jerk.
msgctxt "10968_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. Anyway, it's nothing to get upset about."
msgstr "Sí. De todos modos, no es nada por lo que molestarse."

msgctxt "10980_Noa"
msgid "Thanks! I feel better now. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Gracias. Ya me siento mejor. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you read much?
msgctxt "10992_Akiyama"
msgid "Do you read much? You can't expect to be smart if all you do is watch TV."
msgstr "¿Lees mucho? No puedes esperar ser inteligente si lo único que haces es ver la tele."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you read much?
msgctxt "11004_Noa"
msgid "Huh? You think I'm stupid, too?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Usted también cree que soy estúpida?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you read much?
msgctxt "11016_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, somebody your age who reads a fair amount would understand it."
msgstr "Bueno, alguien de tu edad que lea bastante lo entendería."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you read much?
msgctxt "11028_Noa"
msgid "Oh... I didn't know."
msgstr "Oh... No lo sabía."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you read much?
msgctxt "11040_Akiyama"
msgid "Why don't you read a book once in a while? They can be pretty interesting."
msgstr "¿Por qué no lees un libro de vez en cuando? Pueden ser muy interesantes."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=19
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 19
#. y4:msg_talk=19
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T19.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Do you read much?
msgctxt "11052_Noa"
msgid "Er, I'm not much of a reader."
msgstr "Eh, no soy un gran lectora."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They just like talking to each other like that.
msgctxt "11064_Noa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11076_Akiyama"
msgid "Does this mean that you've got another stalker?"
msgstr "¿Significa esto que tienes otro acosador?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11088_Noa"
msgid "Wait, why!?"
msgstr "Espera, ¿¡por qué!?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11100_Akiyama"
msgid "Hahaha."
msgstr "Ja, ja, ja."

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=20
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Well, you're certainly popular. -> T20.P5 | 2. Things are getting interesting. -> T20.P12 | 3. I don't think he'll be the last, either. -> T20.P22
msgctxt "11112_Noa"
msgid "Ugh... I don't know what to do."
msgstr "Ugh... No sé qué hacer."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11124_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, you're certainly popular. Most hostesses don't have that kind of following."
msgstr "Bueno, ciertamente eres popular. La mayoría de las hostesses no tienen ese tipo de seguidores."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11136_Noa"
msgid "But I don't like it at all! I wonder what the other girls would do in this situation."
msgstr "¡Pero no me gusta nada! Me pregunto qué harían las demás chicas en esta situación."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11148_Akiyama"
msgid "Huh. Hostesses make most of their money from steady customers. In a way, a stalker is the steadiest customer of all."
msgstr "Huh. Las hostesses hacen la mayor parte de su dinero de los clientes fijos. En cierto modo, un acosador es el cliente más fijo de todos."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11160_Akiyama"
msgid "And at least your customers aren't getting into fights over you. Not yet, anyway."
msgstr "Y al menos tus clientes no se están metiendo en peleas por ti. Todavía no, de todos modos."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11172_Noa"
msgid "Ugh, I'm starting to get sick of this job."
msgstr "Ugh, estoy empezando a cansarme de este trabajo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11184_Akiyama"
msgid "Even if you quit, there's no guarantee they'll leave you alone."
msgstr "Aunque renuncies, no hay garantía de que te dejen en paz."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Well, you're certainly popular.
msgctxt "11196_Noa"
msgid "I know. I'm so depressed..."
msgstr "Lo sé. Estoy tan deprimida..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11208_Akiyama"
msgid "Things are getting interesting. I wonder what'll happen next."
msgstr "Las cosas se están poniendo interesantes. Me pregunto qué pasará a continuación."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11220_Noa"
msgid "Hey, are you enjoying this?"
msgstr "Oiga, ¿está disfrutando de esto?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11232_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. At this point, you can either be afraid or sit back and enjoy the ride."
msgstr "Claro. En este punto, puedes tener miedo o sentarte y disfrutar del viaje."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11244_Noa"
msgid "Heh. It is kind of ridiculous when you think about it."
msgstr "Je. Es un poco ridículo si te pones a pensarlo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11256_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. We could try to predict which of your customers will turn into stalkers next."
msgstr "Sí. Podríamos intentar predecir cuál de tus clientes se convertirá en acosador."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11268_Noa"
msgid "Hahaha! Isn't that a little rude?"
msgstr "¡Jajaja! ¿No es eso un poco grosero?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11280_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure, you say that, but I bet you have an idea of who will be next."
msgstr "Seguro que dices eso, pero apuesto a que tienes una idea de quién será el siguiente."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11292_Noa"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr "Tal vez..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11304_Akiyama"
msgid "Ha! See? You'd better keep an eye on him."
msgstr "¡Ja! ¿Ves? Será mejor que lo vigiles."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Things are getting interesting.
msgctxt "11316_Noa"
msgid "Oh, I will."
msgstr "Oh, lo haré."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11328_Akiyama"
msgid "I don't think he'll be the last, either. This is beginning to get serious."
msgstr "Tampoco creo que sea el último. Esto está empezando a ponerse serio."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11340_Noa"
msgid "I know. I'm getting scared of my customers now. All I do now is wonder if he's going to be my next stalker."
msgstr "Lo sé, lo sé. Me estoy asustando de mis clientes ahora. Todo lo que hago ahora es preguntarme si va a ser mi próximo acosador."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11352_Akiyama"
msgid "Maybe it's time to quit."
msgstr "Tal vez sea hora de dejarlo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11364_Noa"
msgid "Huh? Stop being a hostess?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Dejar de ser hostess?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11376_Akiyama"
msgid "It's an option."
msgstr "Es una opción."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=27
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P27
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11388_Noa"
msgid "But what if they keep stalking me after I quit?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿qué pasa si me siguen acosando después de que renuncie?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=28
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P28
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11400_Akiyama"
msgid "You could have a talk with them. Set them straight."
msgstr "Podrías hablar con ellos. Déjarles las cosas claras."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=20
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 20
#. y4:msg_talk=20
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T20.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=I don't think he'll be the last, either.
msgctxt "11412_Noa"
msgid "Maybe you're right."
msgstr "Tal vez tengas razón."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11424_Noa"
msgid "You were right about me."
msgstr "Usted tenía razón sobre mí."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11436_Akiyama"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr "¿Cómo es eso?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11448_Noa"
msgid "One of my male friends told me that he liked me. You know, romantically. I had to tell him I wasn't interested."
msgstr "Uno de mis amigos me dijo que le gustaba. Ya sabe, románticamente. Tuve que decirle que no estaba interesada."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11460_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr "Ah."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11472_Noa"
msgid "We hang out a lot, but I never thought of him that way."
msgstr "Soliamos Salir mucho, pero nunca pensé en él de esa manera."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11484_Noa"
msgid "He said he told me because he thought I felt the same way."
msgstr "Me dijo que pensaba que yo sentía lo mismo."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11496_Akiyama"
msgid "Wow. He must've been hurt when you told him you didn't."
msgstr "Vaya. Debió dolerle cuando le dijiste que no."

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=21
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Men and women can't be friends. -> T21.P8 | 2. You have to be careful. -> T21.P15 | 3. It's not your fault. -> T21.P27
msgctxt "11508_Noa"
msgid "It was my fault, right? I must've led him on."
msgstr "Fue mi culpa, ¿verdad? Debí haberlo engañado."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11520_Akiyama"
msgid "Men and women can't be friends. When a man gets close to a woman, he always starts to think about her romantically."
msgstr "Los hombres y las mujeres no pueden ser amigos. Cuando un hombre se acerca a una mujer, siempre empieza a pensar en ella románticamente."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11532_Noa"
msgid "That can't be true. There are lots of guys I'm friends with."
msgstr "Eso no puede ser verdad. Hay muchos chicos de los que soy amiga."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11544_Akiyama"
msgid "But the closer you get to them, the more they're going to get the wrong idea."
msgstr "Pero cuanto más te acerques a ellos, más se van a hacer una idea equivocada."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11556_Akiyama"
msgid "Leaving a little distance between you will actually make your relationship better."
msgstr "Dejar un poco de distancia entre ustedes en realidad hará que su relación mejore."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11568_Noa"
msgid "Hmm. I've always enjoyed talking with men more than women, so perhaps I've been too casual with my male friends."
msgstr "Hmm. Siempre me ha gustado más hablar con hombres que con mujeres, así que quizá he sido demasiado informal con mis amigos varones."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11580_Akiyama"
msgid "You just need to think a bit more about how they feel."
msgstr "Sólo tienes que pensar un poco más en cómo se sienten."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Men and women can't be friends.
msgctxt "11592_Noa"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Bueno..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11604_Akiyama"
msgid "You have to be careful. Men can be animals. They may act nice, but you never know what they're thinking."
msgstr "Tienes que tener cuidado. Los hombres pueden ser animales. Pueden actuar bien, pero nunca sabes lo que están pensando."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11616_Noa"
msgid "I guess you're right..."
msgstr "Supongo que tiene razón..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11628_Noa"
msgid "...Are you that way, too?"
msgstr "... ¿Usted también es así?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You sound like a guy.
msgctxt "11640_Akiyama"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11652_Noa"
msgid "Do you think of me as a possible girlfriend?"
msgstr "¿Piensa en mí como una posible novia?"

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=23
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 23
#. y4:msg_talk=190
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T190.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T23.P5
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T23.P5..P12
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=Of course. Why would having a girlfriend make a difference?
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 05 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "11664_Akiyama"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "No se preocupe."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11676_Akiyama"
msgid "But I don't sneak around like those stalkers of yours. If I like somebody, I come out and say so."
msgstr "Pero yo no ando a escondidas como esos acosadores tuyos. Si me gusta alguien, lo digo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11688_Noa"
msgid "Heh, that makes me feel better."
msgstr "Je, eso me hace sentir mejor."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11700_Noa"
msgid "So then, is there anything you're planning on telling me?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿hay algo que planee decirme?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11712_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, are you trying to get me to tell you I'm in love with you?"
msgstr "Oye, ¿estás tratando de que te diga que estoy enamorado de ti?"

msgctxt "11724_Noa"
msgid "Hehe. A real man wouldn't beat around the bush, would he? <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Je, je. Un hombre de verdad no se andaría con rodeos, ¿verdad? <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You have to be careful.
msgctxt "11736_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, brother."
msgstr "Oh, vamos hermano."

#. y4:msg_type=choice
#. y4:msg_label=Opción del jugador
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=186
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T186.P0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_opcode=0x0111
#. y4:msg_branch_target=T21.P27
#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T21.P27..P35
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=It's not your fault.
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 1b 00 00 00 14 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "11748_Akiyama"
msgid "It's not your fault."
msgstr "No es tu culpa."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=18
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 18
#. y4:msg_talk=18
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T18.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Why'd he get so mad about something like that?
msgctxt "11760_Noa"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad lo cree?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11772_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. Men falling for women is the most natural thing in the world."
msgstr "Claro. Que los hombres se enamoren de las mujeres es lo más natural del mundo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11784_Akiyama"
msgid "And they shouldn't sneak around about it. Your friend had the right idea. They should just be honest about how they feel."
msgstr "Y no deberían esconder sus sentimientos al respecto. Tu amigo tiene razón. Deberían ser honestas sobre cómo se sienten."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11796_Noa"
msgid "But how can I face him now? It's gonna be so awkward."
msgstr "¿Pero ahora cómo podre verle la cara? Va a ser tan incómodo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=32
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P32
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11808_Akiyama"
msgid "If you want to stay friends, tell him that. And if he still wants something more, it's better not to see him anymore."
msgstr "Si quieren seguir siendo amigos, díselo. Y si todavía quiere algo más, es mejor no verlo más."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=33
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P33
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11820_Noa"
msgid "Okay. I'll do that."
msgstr "Bien. Lo haré."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=34
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P34
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11832_Noa"
msgid "You always give the best advice. You're so mature."
msgstr "Usted siempre da los mejores consejos. Es tan maduro."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=21
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 21
#. y4:msg_talk=21
#. y4:msg_phrase=35
#. y4:msg_location=T21.P35
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=It's not your fault.
msgctxt "11844_Akiyama"
msgid "Eh, I've learned a thing or two along the way."
msgstr "Eh, he aprendido un par de cosas en el camino."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11856_Noa"
msgid "Ugh! That stalker started following me back to my neighborhood!"
msgstr "¡Ugh! ¡Ese acosador comenzó a seguirme de regreso a mi vecindario!"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11868_Akiyama"
msgid "Which one? Stalker A or Stalker B?"
msgstr "¿Cuál? ¿Acosador A o Acosador B?"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "11880_Noa"
msgid "Huh? Oh. Um, the new one."
msgstr "¿Eh? Oh. Um, el nuevo."

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "11892_Akiyama"
msgid "Stalker B, then. Sounds like he's escalating things."
msgstr "Acosador B, entonces. Parece que está escalando las cosas."

#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_decision_group=22
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. He needs to be taught a lesson. -> T22.P5 | 2. You'll just have to move. -> T22.P13 | 3. Let's just see what happens. -> T22.P21
msgctxt "11904_Noa"
msgid "I'm starting to get scared. What should I do?"
msgstr "Estoy empezando a asustarme. ¿Qué debería hacer?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "11916_Akiyama"
msgid "He needs to be taught a lesson. Next time you see him, give me a call."
msgstr "Necesita una lección. La próxima vez que lo veas, llámame."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "11928_Noa"
msgid "Huh? What would you do?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Qué va a hacer?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "11940_Akiyama"
msgid "I'll knock some sense into him. It sounds like he could use a good punch."
msgstr "Lo haré entrar en razón. Parece que le vendría bien un buen puñetazo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "11952_Noa"
msgid "But what if you get hurt?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿y si se lastima?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "11964_Akiyama"
msgid "I'd rather be the one who gets hurt instead of you."
msgstr "Prefiero ser yo el que salga herido en lugar de ti."

msgctxt "11976_Noa"
msgid "Oh. That's so sweet. You're so good to me. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Oh. Eso es tan dulce. Usted es tan bueno conmigo. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "11988_Akiyama"
msgid "Just let me take care of it, okay?"
msgstr "Solo déjame encargarme de eso, ¿de acuerdo?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=He needs to be taught a lesson.
msgctxt "12000_Noa"
msgid "Okay. Thank you so much!"
msgstr "Bien. ¡Muchas gracias!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12012_Akiyama"
msgid "You'll just have to move. It's not safe around your apartment anymore."
msgstr "Tendrás que mudarte. Tu apartamento ya no es seguro."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12024_Noa"
msgid "But he can just follow me home again, can't he?"
msgstr "Pero puede seguirme a casa de nuevo, ¿no?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12036_Akiyama"
msgid "Then you'll have to quit your job and move far away."
msgstr "Entonces tendrás que dejar tu trabajo y mudarte lejos."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12048_Noa"
msgid "I don't wanna do that! I'd have to leave you."
msgstr "¡No quiero hacer eso! Tendría que dejarlo."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12060_Noa"
msgid "And there's no guarantee that he won't track me down again..."
msgstr "Y no hay garantía de que no me rastree de nuevo..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12072_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Mmm..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You'll just have to move.
msgctxt "12084_Noa"
msgid "I won't be safe anywhere I go. This is terrible."
msgstr "No estaré a salvo a dondequiera que vaya. Esto es terrible."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They just like talking to each other like that.
msgctxt "12096_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Let's just see what happens.
msgctxt "12108_Akiyama"
msgid "Let's just see what happens. Neither of your stalkers have done anything to you yet."
msgstr "Vamos a ver qué pasa. Ninguno de tus acosadores te ha hecho nada todavía."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Let's just see what happens.
msgctxt "12120_Noa"
msgid "But if we wait until they do something, it may be too late!"
msgstr "Pero si esperamos a que hagan algo, ¡puede que sea demasiado tarde!"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Let's just see what happens.
msgctxt "12132_Noa"
msgid "Don't you care if something happens to me?"
msgstr "¿A usted no le importa si me pasa algo?"

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Let's just see what happens.
msgctxt "12144_Akiyama"
msgid "Of course I do. But I don't want to make the situation worse by provoking them."
msgstr "Por supuesto que me importa. Pero no quiero empeorar la situación provocándolos."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Let's just see what happens.
msgctxt "12156_Noa"
msgid "I thought you'd be able to help me..."
msgstr "Pensé que usted podría ayudarme..."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=22
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 22
#. y4:msg_talk=22
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T22.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Let's just see what happens.
msgctxt "12168_Noa"
msgid "Maybe I'll talk to the police."
msgstr "Tal vez hable con la policía."

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=2
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T2.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=They just like talking to each other like that.
msgctxt "12180_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=23
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 23
