msgid "I see... That's unfortunate."
msgstr "Ya veo... ni modo..."

msgctxt "17268_Noa"
msgid "Thanks for replying to my mail! For some reason, I can talk to you without getting nervous. It's so relaxing. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Gracias por responder a mi correo! ♪\n"
"De alguna manera, con usted, puedo hablar sin preocupaciones. Es realmente muy relajante. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=116
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T116.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "17280_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. It is for me too."
msgstr "Je, je, je. Lo es para mí también."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=117
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T117.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "17292_Noa"
msgid "I bought that outfit I found the other day. I think I deserve it."
msgstr "Me compré este conjunto que encontré el otro día. Creo que me lo merezco."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=117
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T117.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "17304_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. I wouldn't mind seeing you in it, you know."
msgstr "Sí, no me importaría verte en él, sabes."

msgctxt "17316_Noa"
msgid "Hey, are you inviting me on a date? Hehe! You can't trick me. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Oiga, ¿me estáa invitando a una cita? ¡Jeje! No puede engañarme. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "17328_Noa"
msgid "You don't look like a slow driver. You should come with me to a race sometime. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Usted no parece un conductor lento. Debería venir conmigo a una carrera alguna vez. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=118
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T118.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "17340_Akiyama"
msgid "But shouldn't a guy drive safely when he's on a date?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿no debería un hombre conducir de manera segura cuando está en una cita?"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=119
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T119.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "17352_Noa"
msgid "Ugh! This diet is driving me crazy... It's not fair."
msgstr "¡Ugh! Esta dieta me está volviendo loca... No es justo."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=119
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T119.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "17364_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, don't bring me down just because you don't like your diet. There's a reason why I'm not on one myself."
msgstr "Oye, no me desanimes solo porque no te gusta tu dieta. Hay una razón por la que yo no estoy en una."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=119
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T119.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "17376_Noa"
msgid "Maybe you should be! You can go on a diet with me! You should be watching your weight at your age, anyway."
msgstr "¡Quizás debería! ¡Puede ponerse a dieta conmigo! De todas formas, ya a su edad debería vigilar su peso."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=119
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T119.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "17388_Akiyama"
msgid "Gimme a break..."
msgstr "Dame un respiro..."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=120
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T120.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Noa
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "17400_Noa"
msgid "Whew! I'm done dieting. I lost the weight I wanted to."
msgstr "¡Uf! He terminado la dieta. He perdido el peso que quería."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=120
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T120.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "17412_Akiyama"
msgid "That's great, but if you go back to eating cake, you'll just gain it right back."
msgstr "Eso es genial, pero si vuelves a comer pastel, lo recuperarás de inmediato."

msgctxt "17424_Noa"
msgid "Then I'll go on another diet. Easy! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Entonces haré otra dieta. ¡Fácil! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

